OL,3,GNEWSAPedicabs in London must now be    
OL,4,Alicensed                               
OL,6,FLondon's pedicab drivers and operators 
OL,7,Fmust now hold a valid licence as the   
OL,8,Fsector comes under formal regulation   
OL,9,Ffor the first time.                    
OL,11,FOperating without a valid licence      
OL,12,Fissued by Transport for London (TfL)   
OL,13,Fhas become a criminal offence. Drivers 
OL,14,Fof the rickshaw-style bikes must also  
OL,15,Fwear an official TfL identification    
OL,16,Fbadge on their arm to show they are    
OL,17,Flicensed.                              
OL,19,FA TfL spokesperson said the regulations
OL,20,Fwould help maintain "high standards of 
OL,21,Fsafety and accountability" across      
OL,22,FLondon's transport network.            
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
